     *    - PRESC  = 15  -> t_PRESC = (15 + 1) / 170 MHz = 94.12 ns
     *    - SCLDEL = 4   -> t_SCLDEL = (4 + 1) * 94.12 ns = 470.6 ns (setup time > 250 ns)
     *    - SDADEL = 2   -> t_SDADEL = 2 * 94.12 ns = 188.2 ns (hold time)
     *    - SCLH   = 50  -> t_HIGH = (50 + 1) * 94.12 ns = 4.80 us
     *    - SCLL   = 54  -> t_LOW  = (54 + 1) * 94.12 ns = 5.18 us
